  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}状态不错嘛。\n不过，现在得意还太早。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_241.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}呜……\n要是这里不是鬼屋，\n我就能更专心了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_241.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}特训也是为了克服这一点。\n尤其是你，实在太害怕了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_241.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}连没有实体的东西都怕，\n又怎么对付有实体的对手。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e821_241.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
